<title>LATVIA: LATVIA - JUNE UNEMPLOYMENT 7.6 PCT VS 7.7 PCT IN MAY.</title>
<headline>LATVIA - JUNE UNEMPLOYMENT 7.6 PCT VS 7.7 PCT IN MAY.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The statistics committee on Tuesday said that unemployment in Latvia was 7.6 percent in June versus 7.7 percent the month before.</p>
<p>Riga had unemployment of 3.4 percent in June versus 3.5 percent in May, Daugavpils joblessness was 8.4 percent in June versus 8.5 percent while some 8.5 percent of the town of Jelgava was unemployed, unchanged from the previous month, the committee added in a statement.  </p>
<p>Ventspils had the lowest unemployment at 3.1 percent versus 3.2 percent in May.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
